{title: Lived Near Their Kinsmen}
{subtitle: 1 Chronicles 8:32; 9:38; 8:29–33; 9:35–39; 2 Samuel 13:3–32; 21:21}
{key: Eb}
{tempo: 81}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Eb] | [Abmaj7] | [Cm7] | [Abmaj7] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]Mikloth fathered Shimeah
Living op[Cm7]posite their kin
In the [Abmaj7]city of Jerusalem
With relatives nearby [Eb]then
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Lived near their kins[Abmaj7]men
In the holy c[Cm7]ity
With their [Abmaj7]relatives [Bbsus4]
In the [Eb]land
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Jeiel lived in Gibeon [Ebmaj7/D]
[Cm7]Wife Maacah by his side
[Abmaj7]Abdon was the firstborn son
Zur and Kish in that [Eb]line
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Lived near [Eb/G]their kins[Abmaj7]men
In the holy c[Cm7]ity
With their [Abmaj7]relatives [Bbsus4]
In the [Eb]land [Ebmaj7/D]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Cm7]Ner fathered Kish the king
[Abmaj7]Saul was born of that line
[Eb]Jonathan and Malchishua
A[Bb]binadab and Eshbaal
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Eb]Mikloth was the father
Of Shimeam [Ab]in the genealo[Eb]gy
{end_of_verse}
